concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-2a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2A Application of Act to Commonwealth and Commonwealth"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-2a ;
    values:originalText "authorities  (1) Subject to this section and sections 44AC, 44E and 95D, this Act binds the Crown in right of the Commonwealth in so far as the Crown in right of the Commonwealth carries on a business, either directly or by an authority of the Commonwealth.  (2) Subject to the succeeding provisions of this section, this Act applies as if:  (a) the Commonwealth, in so far as it carries on a business otherwise than by an authority of the Commonwealth; and  (b) each authority of the Commonwealth (whether or not acting as an agent of the Crown in right of the Commonwealth) in so far as it carries on a business; were a corporation.  Chapter 1  Preliminary" ;
    skos:definition "authorities  (1) Subject to this section and sections 44AC, 44E and 95D, this Act binds the Crown in right of the Commonwealth in so far as the Crown in right of the Commonwealth carries on a business, either directly or by an authority of the Commonwealth.  (2) Subject to the succeeding provisions of this section, this Act applies as if:  (a) the Commonwealth, in so far as it carries on a business otherwise than by an authority of the Commonwealth; and  (b) each authority of the Commonwealth (whether or not acting as an agent of the Crown in right of the Commonwealth) in so far as it carries on a business; were a corporation.  Chapter 1  Preliminary"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9756757b8c6dd29422388434c0fda529a4a8b5bc95d590808b958a1d60325117" ;
    cof:pageNumber "29"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-2a-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-2a-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.29" .
