    skos:definition "(2) Subject to the succeeding provisions of this section, this Act applies as if:  (a) the Commonwealth, in so far as it carries on a business otherwise than by an authority of the Commonwealth; and  (b) each authority of the Commonwealth (whether or not acting as an agent of the Crown in right of the Commonwealth) in so far as it carries on a business; were a corporation.  Chapter 1  Preliminary"@en ;
