concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-2ba a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2BA Application of Parts IV and IVA to local government bodies"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-2ba ;
    values:originalText "(1) Parts IV and IVA apply in relation to a local government body only to the extent that it carries on a business, either directly or by an incorporated company in which it has a controlling interest.  Preliminary  Chapter 1 Preliminary  Part I  Section 2C  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (2) In this section: local government body means a body established by or under a law of a State or Territory for the purposes of local government, other than a body established solely or primarily for the purposes of providing a particular service, such as the supply of electricity or water." ;
    skos:definition "(1) Parts IV and IVA apply in relation to a local government body only to the extent that it carries on a business, either directly or by an incorporated company in which it has a controlling interest.  Preliminary  Chapter 1 Preliminary  Part I  Section 2C  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (2) In this section: local government body means a body established by or under a law of a State or Territory for the purposes of local government, other than a body established solely or primarily for the purposes of providing a particular service, such as the supply of electricity or water."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c6e12817745bd8d22ecc2350f13213884800042148a41543f4b4615296df27c8" ;
    cof:pageNumber "30"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-2ba-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-2ba-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.30" .
doc:sec-2ba a cof:Section ;
