concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 Interpretation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-4 ;
    values:originalText "(1) In this Act, unless the contrary intention appears: accountable authority has the same meaning as in the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013. Accreditation Registrar means:  (a) if a person holds an appointment under subsection 56CK(1)—that person; or  (b) otherwise—the Commission. accredited action initiator has the meaning given by section 56AMC. accredited data recipient has the meaning given by section 56AK. accredited person means a person who holds an accreditation under subsection 56CA(1). ACMA means the Australian Communications and Media Authority. acquire includes:  (a) in relation to goods—acquire by way of purchase, exchange or taking on lease, on hire or on hire-purchase; and  (b) in relation to services—accept. acquisition determination, in respect of a notification of an acquisition, means:  (a) a determination made under subsection 51ABZE(1) in respect of the notification; or  Chapter 1  Preliminary" ;
    skos:definition "(1) In this Act, unless the contrary intention appears: accountable authority has the same meaning as in the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013. Accreditation Registrar means:  (a) if a person holds an appointment under subsection 56CK(1)—that person; or  (b) otherwise—the Commission. accredited action initiator has the meaning given by section 56AMC. accredited data recipient has the meaning given by section 56AK. accredited person means a person who holds an accreditation under subsection 56CA(1). ACMA means the Australian Communications and Media Authority. acquire includes:  (a) in relation to goods—acquire by way of purchase, exchange or taking on lease, on hire or on hire-purchase; and  (b) in relation to services—accept. acquisition determination, in respect of a notification of an acquisition, means:  (a) a determination made under subsection 51ABZE(1) in respect of the notification; or  Chapter 1  Preliminary"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4387bed88bd2ef91d59961a1a64ddca4b22914dd90f9870845f131f8682621a5" ;
    cof:pageNumber "33"^^xsd:integer ;
