concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-4ka a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4KA Definitions etc. that do not apply in Part XI or Schedule 2"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-4ka ;
    values:originalText "Despite any other provision of this Act, sections 4 to 4K do not affect the meaning of any expression used in Part XI or Schedule 2, unless a contrary intention appears." ;
    skos:definition "Despite any other provision of this Act, sections 4 to 4K do not affect the meaning of any expression used in Part XI or Schedule 2, unless a contrary intention appears."@en ;
