concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-4m a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4M Saving of law relating to restraint of trade and breaches of"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-4m ;
    values:originalText "confidence  (1) This Act does not affect the operation of:  (a) the law relating to restraint of trade in so far as that law is capable of operating concurrently with this Act; or  (b) the law relating to breaches of confidence; but nothing in the law referred to in paragraph (a) or (b) affects the interpretation of this Act.  (2) Paragraph (1)(b) does not apply for the purposes of section 57CD." ;
    skos:definition "confidence  (1) This Act does not affect the operation of:  (a) the law relating to restraint of trade in so far as that law is capable of operating concurrently with this Act; or  (b) the law relating to breaches of confidence; but nothing in the law referred to in paragraph (a) or (b) affects the interpretation of this Act.  (2) Paragraph (1)(b) does not apply for the purposes of section 57CD."@en ;
