    values:originalText "(1) Each of the following provisions:  (a) Part IV;  (aa) Part IVBA;  (ab) Part IVE;  (b) Part XI;  (ba) Part XICA;  (c) the Australian Consumer Law (other than Part 5-3);  (f) the remaining provisions of this Act (to the extent to which they relate to any of the provisions covered by paragraph (a), (aa), (ab), (b), (ba) or (c));  (fa) the acquisitions provisions; extends to the engaging in conduct outside Australia by:  (g) bodies corporate incorporated or carrying on business within Australia; or  (h) Australian citizens; or  (i) persons ordinarily resident within Australia." ;
    cof:pageNumber "65"^^xsd:integer .

