doc:sec-8ab-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "8AB(3) AER members taken to be associate members" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) As an associate member, the AER member holds office on such terms and conditions as are specified in the instrument of his or her appointment under section 44AM or 44AP." ;
    cof:pageNumber "79"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9 Remuneration"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-9 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A member of the Commission shall be paid such remuneration as is determined by the Remuneration Tribunal, but, until that remuneration is so determined, he or she shall be paid such remuneration as is prescribed.  (2) Subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act 1973, a member of the Commission shall be paid such allowances as are prescribed.  (3) In this section, member of the Commission includes an associate member of the Commission.  Chapter 1  Preliminary" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A member of the Commission shall be paid such remuneration as is determined by the Remuneration Tribunal, but, until that remuneration is so determined, he or she shall be paid such remuneration as is prescribed.  (2) Subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act 1973, a member of the Commission shall be paid such allowances as are prescribed.  (3) In this section, member of the Commission includes an associate member of the Commission.  Chapter 1  Preliminary"@en ;
