doc:sec-11-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "11(1) Acting Chairperson" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) Where there is, or is expected to be, a vacancy in the office of Chairperson, the Governor-General may appoint a person to act as Chairperson until the filling of the vacancy.  Preliminary  Chapter 1 The Australian Competition and Consumer Commission  Part II  Section 12  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  Note: For rules that apply to acting appointments, see section 33A of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901." ;
