concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-11-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "11(2) Acting Chairperson"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-11-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Where the Chairperson is absent from duty or from Australia:  (a) if there are 2 Deputy Chairpersons available to act as Chairperson, the Minister may appoint 1 of them to act as Chairperson during the absence of the Chairperson; or  (b) if there is only 1 Deputy Chairperson available to act as Chairperson, that Deputy Chairperson is to act as Chairperson during the absence of the Chairperson; or  (c) if there are no Deputy Chairpersons or none of the Deputy Chairpersons are available to act as Chairperson, the Minister may appoint a member of the Commission to act as Chairperson during the absence of the Chairperson, but any such appointment ceases to have effect if a person is appointed as a Deputy Chairperson or a Deputy Chairperson becomes available to act as Chairperson. Note: For rules that apply to persons acting as the Chairperson, see section 33A of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901." ;
    skos:definition "(2) Where the Chairperson is absent from duty or from Australia:  (a) if there are 2 Deputy Chairpersons available to act as Chairperson, the Minister may appoint 1 of them to act as Chairperson during the absence of the Chairperson; or  (b) if there is only 1 Deputy Chairperson available to act as Chairperson, that Deputy Chairperson is to act as Chairperson during the absence of the Chairperson; or  (c) if there are no Deputy Chairpersons or none of the Deputy Chairpersons are available to act as Chairperson, the Minister may appoint a member of the Commission to act as Chairperson during the absence of the Chairperson, but any such appointment ceases to have effect if a person is appointed as a Deputy Chairperson or a Deputy Chairperson becomes available to act as Chairperson. Note: For rules that apply to persons acting as the Chairperson, see section 33A of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3a9a504c8e7fa1ea73a1e8de2fff2323811635f3935adac456ab59850f8d42e0" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-11 ;
    cof:pageNumber "80"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Minister must appoint a Deputy Chairperson to act as Chairperson in absence of Chairperson." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
