concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-12 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "12 Leave of absence"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-12 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A member of the Commission has such recreation leave entitlements as are determined by the Remuneration Tribunal.  (2) The Minister may grant a member of the Commission leave of absence, other than recreation leave, on such terms and conditions as to remuneration or otherwise as the Minister determines." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A member of the Commission has such recreation leave entitlements as are determined by the Remuneration Tribunal.  (2) The Minister may grant a member of the Commission leave of absence, other than recreation leave, on such terms and conditions as to remuneration or otherwise as the Minister determines."@en ;
