concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-15 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15 Resignation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A member of the Commission may resign his or her office by writing signed by him or her and delivered to the Governor-General.  (2) An associate member of the Commission may resign his or her office by writing signed by him or her and delivered to the Minister." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A member of the Commission may resign his or her office by writing signed by him or her and delivered to the Governor-General.  (2) An associate member of the Commission may resign his or her office by writing signed by him or her and delivered to the Minister."@en ;
