concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-18-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "18(4) Meetings of Commission"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-18-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) In the absence of the Chairperson from a meeting of the Commission:  (a) if there are 2 Deputy Chairpersons available to preside at the meeting—the Chairperson may nominate 1 of them to preside at the meeting; or  (b) if there is only 1 Deputy Chairperson available to preside at the meeting—that Deputy Chairperson is to preside at the meeting." ;
    skos:definition "(4) In the absence of the Chairperson from a meeting of the Commission:  (a) if there are 2 Deputy Chairpersons available to preside at the meeting—the Chairperson may nominate 1 of them to preside at the meeting; or  (b) if there is only 1 Deputy Chairperson available to preside at the meeting—that Deputy Chairperson is to preside at the meeting."@en ;
