concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-18-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "18(6) Meetings of Commission"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-18-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) At a meeting of the Commission:  Preliminary  Chapter 1 The Australian Competition and Consumer Commission  Part II  Section 19  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (a) three members (including the Chairperson or a Deputy Chairperson) form a quorum;  (b) all questions shall be decided by a majority of votes of the members present and voting; and  (c) the member presiding has a deliberative vote and, in the event of an equality of votes, also has a casting vote." ;
    skos:definition "(6) At a meeting of the Commission:  Preliminary  Chapter 1 The Australian Competition and Consumer Commission  Part II  Section 19  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (a) three members (including the Chairperson or a Deputy Chairperson) form a quorum;  (b) all questions shall be decided by a majority of votes of the members present and voting; and  (c) the member presiding has a deliberative vote and, in the event of an equality of votes, also has a casting vote."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f30b570a069465b68f760a8bc6dc1db70e3ce26330bfc1577cf7dff467dcc80c" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-18 ;
    cof:pageNumber "84"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Quorum requirements for Commission meetings" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
