doc:sec-18-ss-6 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "18(6) Meetings of Commission" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(6) At a meeting of the Commission:  Preliminary  Chapter 1 The Australian Competition and Consumer Commission  Part II  Section 19  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (a) three members (including the Chairperson or a Deputy Chairperson) form a quorum;  (b) all questions shall be decided by a majority of votes of the members present and voting; and  (c) the member presiding has a deliberative vote and, in the event of an equality of votes, also has a casting vote." ;
    cof:pageNumber "84"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-18-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "18(7) Meetings of Commission"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-18-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) If the Commission so determines, a member or members may participate in, and form part of a quorum at, a meeting of the Commission or a Division of the Commission by means of any of the following methods of communication:  (a) telephone;  (b) closed circuit television;  (c) another method of communication determined by the Commission." ;
    skos:definition "(7) If the Commission so determines, a member or members may participate in, and form part of a quorum at, a meeting of the Commission or a Division of the Commission by means of any of the following methods of communication:  (a) telephone;  (b) closed circuit television;  (c) another method of communication determined by the Commission."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "74231d4ae799931f521b0ccce286e3a353109358f88704375e94063c98635c01" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-18 ;
    cof:pageNumber "84"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Methods of communication for Commission meetings" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
