concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-26 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26 Delegation by Commission of certain functions and powers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-26 ;
    values:originalText "Delegation to staff members of ASIC  (1) The Commission may, by resolution, delegate:  (a) any of its functions and powers under or in relation to Parts VI and XI and the Australian Consumer Law; and  (b) any of its powers under Part XII that relate to those Parts or the Australian Consumer Law; to a staff member of ASIC.  (2) The Commission must not delegate a function or power under subsection (1) unless the Chairperson of ASIC has agreed to the delegation in writing.  Chapter 1  Preliminary" ;
    skos:definition "Delegation to staff members of ASIC  (1) The Commission may, by resolution, delegate:  (a) any of its functions and powers under or in relation to Parts VI and XI and the Australian Consumer Law; and  (b) any of its powers under Part XII that relate to those Parts or the Australian Consumer Law; to a staff member of ASIC.  (2) The Commission must not delegate a function or power under subsection (1) unless the Chairperson of ASIC has agreed to the delegation in writing.  Chapter 1  Preliminary"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "87a85f4e5a41dff16fa1182329ebdf42f4113b7c09bc77eb122c3d2013286e1a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "87"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-26-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-26-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.87" .
doc:sec-26 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "26 Delegation by Commission of certain functions and powers" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Delegation to staff members of ASIC  (1) The Commission may, by resolution, delegate:  (a) any of its functions and powers under or in relation to Parts VI and XI and the Australian Consumer Law; and  (b) any of its powers under Part XII that relate to those Parts or the Australian Consumer Law; to a staff member of ASIC.  (2) The Commission must not delegate a function or power under subsection (1) unless the Chairperson of ASIC has agreed to the delegation in writing.  Chapter 1  Preliminary" ;
    cof:pageNumber "87"^^xsd:integer .

