concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-27-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "27 Staff of Commission"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-27-2 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The staff necessary to assist the Commission shall be persons engaged under the Public Service Act 1999.  Preliminary  Chapter 1 The Australian Competition and Consumer Commission  Part II  Section 27A  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (2) For the purposes of the Public Service Act 1999:  (a) the Chairperson of the Commission and the APS employees assisting the Chairperson together constitute a Statutory Agency; and  (b) the Chairperson is the Head of that Statutory Agency." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The staff necessary to assist the Commission shall be persons engaged under the Public Service Act 1999.  Preliminary  Chapter 1 The Australian Competition and Consumer Commission  Part II  Section 27A  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (2) For the purposes of the Public Service Act 1999:  (a) the Chairperson of the Commission and the APS employees assisting the Chairperson together constitute a Statutory Agency; and  (b) the Chairperson is the Head of that Statutory Agency."@en ;
