concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-29-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "29(2) Commission to comply with directions of Minister and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-29-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Any direction given to the Commission under subsection (1) shall be in writing and the Minister shall cause a copy of the direction to be published in the Gazette as soon as practicable after the direction is given." ;
