concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-29-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "29(3) Commission to comply with directions of Minister and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-29-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If either House of the Parliament or a Committee of either House, or of both Houses, of the Parliament requires the Commission to furnish to that House or Committee any information concerning the performance of the functions of the Commission under this Act, the Commission shall comply with the requirement.  Chapter 1  Preliminary" ;
    skos:definition "(3) If either House of the Parliament or a Committee of either House, or of both Houses, of the Parliament requires the Commission to furnish to that House or Committee any information concerning the performance of the functions of the Commission under this Act, the Commission shall comply with the requirement.  Chapter 1  Preliminary"@en ;
