    skos:definition "(1) A State/Territory energy law may confer functions or powers, or impose duties, on the Council for the purposes of that law. Note: Section 29BC sets out when such a law imposes a duty on the Council."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4ce5b15866537e2efaca1da70169eb2fd483c201605b4c918c2fd7034b7c7927" ;
