    cof:title "29BB(3) How duty is imposed" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) If, to ensure the validity of the purported imposition of the duty, it is necessary that the duty be imposed by a law of the Commonwealth (rather than by the law of the State or Territory), the duty is taken to be imposed by this Part to the extent necessary to ensure that validity." ;
