concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-29g a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "29G Leave of absence"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-29g ;
    values:originalText "(1) A full-time Councillor has such recreation leave entitlements as are determined by the Remuneration Tribunal.  (2) The Minister may grant a full-time Councillor leave of absence, other than recreation leave, on such terms and conditions as the Minister determines. The terms and conditions may include terms and conditions relating to remuneration.  Preliminary  Chapter 1 The National Competition Council  Part IIA  Section 29H  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A full-time Councillor has such recreation leave entitlements as are determined by the Remuneration Tribunal.  (2) The Minister may grant a full-time Councillor leave of absence, other than recreation leave, on such terms and conditions as the Minister determines. The terms and conditions may include terms and conditions relating to remuneration.  Preliminary  Chapter 1 The National Competition Council  Part IIA  Section 29H  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5c09bd7226daa47a7daff1f93694af0c2306559f0fd243d0eb567c3997379453" ;
    cof:pageNumber "96"^^xsd:integer ;
