concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-29m a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "29M Staff to help Council"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-29m ;
    values:originalText "(1) The staff needed to help the Council are to be persons engaged under the Public Service Act 1999.  (2) For the purposes of the Public Service Act 1999:  (a) the Council President and the APS employees assisting the Council President together constitute a Statutory Agency; and  (b) the Council President is the Head of that Statutory Agency." ;
