concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-31 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "31 Qualifications of members of Tribunal"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-31 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person shall not be appointed as a presidential member of the Tribunal unless he or she is a Judge of a Federal Court, not being the High Court or a court of an external Territory.  (2) A person shall not be appointed as a member of the Tribunal other than a presidential member unless he or she appears to the Governor-General to be qualified for appointment by virtue of his or her knowledge of, or experience in, industry, commerce, economics, law or public administration." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person shall not be appointed as a presidential member of the Tribunal unless he or she is a Judge of a Federal Court, not being the High Court or a court of an external Territory.  (2) A person shall not be appointed as a member of the Tribunal other than a presidential member unless he or she appears to the Governor-General to be qualified for appointment by virtue of his or her knowledge of, or experience in, industry, commerce, economics, law or public administration."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0079198b11ef6c6e6bd7cd05968d2d67213b2ce5d81cdd5fe850780f89907825" ;
    cof:pageNumber "101"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-31-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-31-ss-2 ;
