concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-33 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "33 Remuneration and allowances of members of Tribunal"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-33 ;
    values:originalText "(4) A member of the Tribunal other than a presidential member shall be paid such remuneration as is determined by the Remuneration Tribunal.  (5) A member of the Tribunal other than a presidential member shall be paid such allowances as are prescribed.  (6) Subsections (4) and (5) have effect subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act 1973." ;
    skos:definition "(4) A member of the Tribunal other than a presidential member shall be paid such remuneration as is determined by the Remuneration Tribunal.  (5) A member of the Tribunal other than a presidential member shall be paid such allowances as are prescribed.  (6) Subsections (4) and (5) have effect subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act 1973."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "aeaaed272bf4bfbd6dd76be30b664282bd28c7d967ef5e47f23853adfd60d4c6" ;
