concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-35-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "35(7) Suspension and removal of members of Tribunal"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-35-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) A presidential member of the Tribunal ceases to hold office if he or she no longer holds office as a Judge of a Federal Court, not being the High Court or a court of an external Territory." ;
    skos:definition "(7) A presidential member of the Tribunal ceases to hold office if he or she no longer holds office as a Judge of a Federal Court, not being the High Court or a court of an external Territory."@en ;
