concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-36 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "36 Resignation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-36 ;
    values:originalText "A member of the Tribunal may resign his or her office by writing signed by him or her and delivered to the Governor-General.  Preliminary  Chapter 1 The Australian Competition Tribunal  Part III  Section 37  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026" ;
    skos:definition "A member of the Tribunal may resign his or her office by writing signed by him or her and delivered to the Governor-General.  Preliminary  Chapter 1 The Australian Competition Tribunal  Part III  Section 37  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026"@en ;
