concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "44A Acting appointments"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-44a ;
    values:originalText "The Minister may appoint a person who is engaged under the Public Service Act 1999 to act as the Registrar or as a Deputy Registrar during any period, or during all periods, when:  (a) the Registrar or that Deputy Registrar, as the case may be, is absent from duty or from Australia or is, for any other reason, unable to perform the duties and functions of his or her office; or  (b) there is a vacancy in the office of Registrar or in that office of Deputy Registrar, as the case may be. Note: For rules that apply to acting appointments, see section 33A of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901.  Preliminary  Chapter 1 The Australian Energy Regulator (AER)  Part IIIAA Preliminary  Division 1  Section 44AB  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  Part IIIAA—The Australian Energy Regulator (AER)" ;
    skos:definition "The Minister may appoint a person who is engaged under the Public Service Act 1999 to act as the Registrar or as a Deputy Registrar during any period, or during all periods, when:  (a) the Registrar or that Deputy Registrar, as the case may be, is absent from duty or from Australia or is, for any other reason, unable to perform the duties and functions of his or her office; or  (b) there is a vacancy in the office of Registrar or in that office of Deputy Registrar, as the case may be. Note: For rules that apply to acting appointments, see section 33A of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901.  Preliminary  Chapter 1 The Australian Energy Regulator (AER)  Part IIIAA Preliminary  Division 1  Section 44AB  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  Part IIIAA—The Australian Energy Regulator (AER)"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "62cef4d3d778c7ff7f6257f2e724cf5bddfd59a2eb023959b9fb7068dd85756e" ;
    cof:pageNumber "108"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The Minister may appoint a person to act as Registrar or Deputy Registrar." ;
