doc:sec-44ai-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "44AI(2) Commonwealth consent to conferral of functions etc. on AER" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Subsection (1) does not authorise the conferral of a function or power, or the imposition of a duty, by a State/Territory energy law or local energy instrument to the extent to which:  (a) the conferral or imposition, or the authorisation, would contravene any constitutional doctrines restricting the duties that may be imposed on the AER; or  Preliminary  Chapter 1 The Australian Energy Regulator (AER)  Part IIIAA Functions and powers of the AER  Division 3  Section 44AIA  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (b) the authorisation would otherwise exceed the legislative power of the Commonwealth." ;
    cof:pageNumber "112"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ai-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "44AI(3) Commonwealth consent to conferral of functions etc. on AER"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-44ai-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The AER cannot perform a duty or function, or exercise a power, under a State/Territory energy law or local energy instrument unless the conferral of the function or power, or the imposition of the duty, is in accordance with the Australian Energy Market Agreement, or any other relevant agreement between the Commonwealth and the State or Territory concerned." ;
    skos:definition "(3) The AER cannot perform a duty or function, or exercise a power, under a State/Territory energy law or local energy instrument unless the conferral of the function or power, or the imposition of the duty, is in accordance with the Australian Energy Market Agreement, or any other relevant agreement between the Commonwealth and the State or Territory concerned."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "fc0465312b9968d6e56b716763cd37b880d36756b05208d99a633eaa2b409fc0" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ai ;
    cof:pageNumber "112"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Commonwealth consent required for conferral of functions on AER" ;
