concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ai-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "44AI(5) Commonwealth consent to conferral of functions etc. on AER"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-44ai-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) To avoid doubt, if a State/Territory energy law is also a local energy instrument, subsection (4) applies to the law. 44AIA  No merits review of AER decisions  A decision of the AER under a State/Territory energy law or local energy instrument is not to be subject to merits review (however described) by a body established under a law of a State or Territory." ;
    skos:definition "(5) To avoid doubt, if a State/Territory energy law is also a local energy instrument, subsection (4) applies to the law. 44AIA  No merits review of AER decisions  A decision of the AER under a State/Territory energy law or local energy instrument is not to be subject to merits review (however described) by a body established under a law of a State or Territory."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f7669497ad299fce8b64fac8fac6182651bf2126c0fd9c82ec56a3176f2e35c3" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ai ;
    cof:pageNumber "112"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "No merits review of AER decisions under State/Territory energy laws or local energy instruments." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
