concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44al a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "44AL Powers of the AER"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-44al ;
    values:originalText "The AER has power to do all things necessary or convenient to be done for or in connection with the performance of its functions. Note: State and Territory laws or instruments may also confer powers on the AER in respect of its functions under those laws or instruments: see section 44AI.  Chapter 1  Preliminary Part IIIAA  The Australian Energy Regulator (AER)" ;
    skos:definition "The AER has power to do all things necessary or convenient to be done for or in connection with the performance of its functions. Note: State and Territory laws or instruments may also confer powers on the AER in respect of its functions under those laws or instruments: see section 44AI.  Chapter 1  Preliminary Part IIIAA  The Australian Energy Regulator (AER)"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "001eda03f57c870d0c932770f4f9ead38d99259e03b678742e758176d0fa4d8c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "115"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The AER has power to do all things necessary or convenient." ;
