concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44am-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "44AM(3) Appointment of Commonwealth AER members"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-44am-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A person is not eligible for appointment as a Commonwealth AER member unless the person has knowledge of, or experience in, industry, commerce, economics, law, consumer protection or public administration." ;
