concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ar-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "44AR(4) AER Chair"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-44ar-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If a person who is the AER Deputy Chair ceases to be an AER member, then the person also ceases to be the AER Deputy Chair.  Preliminary  Chapter 1 The Australian Energy Regulator (AER)  Part IIIAA Administrative provisions relating to the AER  Division 4  Section 44ARB  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  Note: A person may cease to be the AER Deputy Chair without ceasing to be an AER member. 44ARB  AER Deputy Chair to act as the AER Chair  The AER Deputy Chair is to act as the AER Chair:  (a) during a vacancy in the office of the AER Chair, whether or not an appointment has previously been made to the office; or  (b) during all periods when the AER Chair:  (i) is absent from duty or from Australia; or  (ii) is, for any reason, unable to perform the duties of the office. Note: See also subsection 33A(2) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901." ;
    skos:definition "(4) If a person who is the AER Deputy Chair ceases to be an AER member, then the person also ceases to be the AER Deputy Chair.  Preliminary  Chapter 1 The Australian Energy Regulator (AER)  Part IIIAA Administrative provisions relating to the AER  Division 4  Section 44ARB  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  Note: A person may cease to be the AER Deputy Chair without ceasing to be an AER member. 44ARB  AER Deputy Chair to act as the AER Chair  The AER Deputy Chair is to act as the AER Chair:  (a) during a vacancy in the office of the AER Chair, whether or not an appointment has previously been made to the office; or  (b) during all periods when the AER Chair:  (i) is absent from duty or from Australia; or  (ii) is, for any reason, unable to perform the duties of the office. Note: See also subsection 33A(2) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c461e73cf8a74d73159d1f0869c80670d93f7c50d8f9a7f5fb00009fa4d49f4f" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ar ;
    cof:pageNumber "118"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Ceasing to be AER member also ceases being AER Chair. If a person ceases to be an AER member, they also cease to be the AER Deputy Chair." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.118" ;
    cml:asserts concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ar-ss-4-norm .
