doc:sec-44az-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "44AZ(3) Resignation" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) A person who is the AER Deputy Chair may resign the person’s appointment as AER Deputy Chair by giving the Governor-General a written resignation. The resignation does not affect the person’s appointment as an AER member. 44AAB  Termination of appointment All AER members" ;
