doc:sec-44aa a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "44AA Objects of Part" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "The objects of this Part are to:  (a) promote the economically efficient operation of, use of and investment in the infrastructure by which services are provided, thereby promoting effective competition in upstream and downstream markets; and  (b) provide a framework and guiding principles to encourage a consistent approach to access regulation in each industry." ;
