concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44k-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "44K(4) Review of declaration"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-44k-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The review by the Tribunal is a re-consideration of the matter based on the information, reports and things referred to in section 44ZZOAA. Note: There are limits on the information to which the Tribunal may have regard (see section 44ZZOAA) and time limits that apply to the Tribunal’s decision on the review (see section 44ZZOA)." ;
    skos:definition "(4) The review by the Tribunal is a re-consideration of the matter based on the information, reports and things referred to in section 44ZZOAA. Note: There are limits on the information to which the Tribunal may have regard (see section 44ZZOAA) and time limits that apply to the Tribunal’s decision on the review (see section 44ZZOA)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "cf56581e5765bf558354c6935726fc1259af7f310377eca7da804b48d269cff0" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44k ;
    cof:pageNumber "159"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Reconsideration of the matter based on specified information and reports." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.159" ;
