concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44kb-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "44KB(5) Tribunal may order costs be awarded"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-44kb-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) If a party (the first party) is ordered to pay some or all of the costs of another party under subsection (1), the amount of the costs may be recovered in the Federal Court as a debt due by the first party to the other party." ;
    skos:definition "(5) If a party (the first party) is ordered to pay some or all of the costs of another party under subsection (1), the amount of the costs may be recovered in the Federal Court as a debt due by the first party to the other party."@en ;
