    cof:title "44LD(7) Time limit for Council recommendations" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(7) If the Council is unable to make a recommendation within the consideration period (whether it is the expected period or it has been previously extended under this subsection), it must, by notice in writing to the designated Minister, extend the consideration period by a specified period." ;
