concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ld-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "44LD(8) Time limit for Council recommendations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-44ld-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) The notice must:  (a) specify when the Council must now make a recommendation on the application; and  (b) include a statement explaining why the Council has been unable to make a decision on the recommendation within the consideration period." ;
    skos:definition "(8) The notice must:  (a) specify when the Council must now make a recommendation on the application; and  (b) include a statement explaining why the Council has been unable to make a decision on the recommendation within the consideration period."@en ;
