    cof:title "44LD(10) Time limit for Council recommendations" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(10) If the Council extends the consideration period under subsection (7), it must publish a notice in a manner that results in the notice being accessible to the public and reasonably prominent:  (a) stating that it has done so; and  (b) specifying the day by which it must now make a recommendation on the application.  Chapter 2  Access to services" ;
