    values:originalText "(7) The Tribunal must:  (a) give a copy of the notice to:  (i) the person who applied for review; and  (ii) the person who is, or expects to be, the provider of the service; and  (iii) any other person who has been made a party to the proceedings for review by the Tribunal; and  (b) publish, by electronic or other means, the notice. Tribunal’s decision" ;
