concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44n-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "44N(2) Ministerial decision on effectiveness of access regime"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-44n-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) In making a decision, the Commonwealth Minister:  (a) must, subject to subsection (2A), apply the relevant principles set out in the Competition Principles Agreement; and  (aa) must have regard to the objects of this Part; and  (b) must, subject to section 44DA, not consider any other matters." ;
    skos:definition "(2) In making a decision, the Commonwealth Minister:  (a) must, subject to subsection (2A), apply the relevant principles set out in the Competition Principles Agreement; and  (aa) must have regard to the objects of this Part; and  (b) must, subject to section 44DA, not consider any other matters."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c50f2aab7595fbc7eaf713d970a1c2007f4fecefcd4f6c984fa7f13398cb1831" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44n ;
    cof:pageNumber "182"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Commonwealth Minister must apply principles and have regard to objects when making a decision." ;
