concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44na-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "44NA(4) Recommendation by Council"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-44na-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The Council must assess whether the access regime (including any proposed variations) is an effective access regime. It must do this in accordance with subsection 44M(4)." ;
