concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44nb a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "44NB Decision by the Commonwealth Minister"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-44nb ;
    values:originalText "(1) On receiving a recommendation under section 44NA, the Commonwealth Minister must assess whether the access regime (including any proposed variations) is an effective access regime. He or she must do this in accordance with subsection 44N(2). Note: The Commonwealth Minister must publish his or her decision: see section 44NG.  Chapter 2  Access to services" ;
    skos:definition "(1) On receiving a recommendation under section 44NA, the Commonwealth Minister must assess whether the access regime (including any proposed variations) is an effective access regime. He or she must do this in accordance with subsection 44N(2). Note: The Commonwealth Minister must publish his or her decision: see section 44NG.  Chapter 2  Access to services"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e67141bd964b6404bb126c67f79c934a930f9dcd117674cc96bd323e060ac5ad" ;
    cof:pageNumber "185"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Must assess effectiveness of access regime upon receiving recommendation." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
