    values:originalText "(2) The notice must specify how submissions may be made and the day by which submissions may be made (which must be at least 14 days after the day the notice is published).  Access to services  Chapter 2 Access to services  Part IIIA Effective access regimes  Division 2A  Section 44NE  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  Consideration of submissions" ;
    cof:pageNumber "192"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ne-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "44NE(3) Council may invite public submissions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-44ne-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Subject to subsection (6), in deciding what recommendation to make, the Council:  (a) must have regard to any submission made on or before the day specified in the notice; and  (b) may disregard any submission made after the day specified in the notice. Council may make submissions publicly available" ;
    skos:definition "(3) Subject to subsection (6), in deciding what recommendation to make, the Council:  (a) must have regard to any submission made on or before the day specified in the notice; and  (b) may disregard any submission made after the day specified in the notice. Council may make submissions publicly available"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1fc2d468e3081d5205b6caf01943dce550dc1a71148b085c51c728601417fca5" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ne ;
    cof:pageNumber "192"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Must consider submissions before specified day, may disregard late submissions." ;
