doc:sec-44nf-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "44NF(3) Publication—Council" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Council must do the things under subsections (1) and (2) on the day the Commonwealth Minister publishes his or her decision on the recommendation or as soon as practicable after that day. Consultation" ;
    cof:pageNumber "194"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44nf-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "44NF(4) Publication—Council"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-44nf-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Before publishing under subsection (1), the Council may give any one or more of the following persons:  (a) the applicant under section 44M or 44NA, or under section 44NBA (unless the recommendation relates to a consideration by the Council under that section on its own initiative);  (b) the provider of the service;  (c) any other person the Council considers appropriate; a notice in writing:  (d) specifying what the Council is proposing to publish; and  (e) inviting the person to make a written submission to the Council within 14 days after the notice is given identifying  Access to services  Chapter 2 Access to services  Part IIIA Effective access regimes  Division 2A  Section 44NG  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  any information the person considers should not be published because of its confidential commercial nature." ;
    skos:definition "(4) Before publishing under subsection (1), the Council may give any one or more of the following persons:  (a) the applicant under section 44M or 44NA, or under section 44NBA (unless the recommendation relates to a consideration by the Council under that section on its own initiative);  (b) the provider of the service;  (c) any other person the Council considers appropriate; a notice in writing:  (d) specifying what the Council is proposing to publish; and  (e) inviting the person to make a written submission to the Council within 14 days after the notice is given identifying  Access to services  Chapter 2 Access to services  Part IIIA Effective access regimes  Division 2A  Section 44NG  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  any information the person considers should not be published because of its confidential commercial nature."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e790960a4c7a56264e62e7067959efc8d669b6a8c2abcb0ccfce863383eeb9dc" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44nf ;
    cof:pageNumber "194"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Notice must be given to persons before publishing under subsection (1)" ;
    dc:description "Notice in writing, specifying what the Council is proposing to publish" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.194" ;
    cml:asserts concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44nf-ss-4-norm .
