doc:sec-44o-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "44O(3) Review of Ministerial decision on effectiveness of access regime" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The review by the Tribunal is a reconsideration of the matter based on the information, reports and things referred to in section 44ZZOAA.  Access to services  Chapter 2 Access to services  Part IIIA Effective access regimes  Division 2A  Section 44P  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  Note: There are limits on the information to which the Tribunal may have regard (see section 44ZZOAA) and time limits that apply to the Tribunal’s decision on the review (see section 44ZZOA)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "196"^^xsd:integer .

