doc:sec-44pf-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "44PF(2) Commission must publish its decisions" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Commission must give a copy of the publication to:  (a) for any decision—the applicant under subsection 44PA(1); and  (b) for a decision under subsection 44PC(2)—the provider of the service. It may also give a copy to any other person the Commission considers appropriate.  Access to services  Chapter 2 Access to services  Part IIIA Competitive tender processes for government owned facilities  Division 2B  Section 44PG  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  Consultation" ;
