doc:sec-44r a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "44R Constitutional limits on operation of this Division" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "This Division does not apply in relation to a third party’s access to a service unless:  (a) the provider is a corporation (or a partnership or joint venture consisting wholly of corporations); or  (b) the third party is a corporation; or  (c) the access is (or would be) in the course of, or for the purposes of, constitutional trade or commerce. Subdivision B—Notification of access disputes" ;
