    skos:prefLabel "44Y Commission may terminate arbitration in certain cases"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-44y ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Commission may at any time terminate an arbitration (without making a final determination) if it thinks that:  (a) the notification of the dispute was vexatious; or  Chapter 2  Access to services" ;
