    skos:prefLabel "44YA Commission must terminate arbitration if declaration varied"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-44ya ;
    values:originalText "or set aside by Tribunal  If the Commission is arbitrating a dispute in relation to a declared service and the Tribunal sets aside or varies the declaration in relation to the service under section 44K, the Commission must terminate the arbitration. Subdivision D—Procedure in arbitrations" ;
