concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44za a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "44ZA Member of the Commission presiding at an arbitration"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-44za ;
    values:originalText "(1) Subject to subsection (2), the Chairperson is to preside at an arbitration.  (2) If the Chairperson is not a member of the Commission as constituted under section 44Z in relation to a particular arbitration, the Chairperson must nominate a member of the Commission to preside at the arbitration.  Access to services  Chapter 2 Access to services  Part IIIA Access to declared services  Division 3  Section 44ZB  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Subject to subsection (2), the Chairperson is to preside at an arbitration.  (2) If the Chairperson is not a member of the Commission as constituted under section 44Z in relation to a particular arbitration, the Chairperson must nominate a member of the Commission to preside at the arbitration.  Access to services  Chapter 2 Access to services  Part IIIA Access to declared services  Division 3  Section 44ZB  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026"@en ;
