doc:sec-44zk a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "44ZK Intimidation etc." ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "A person must not:  (a) threaten, intimidate or coerce another person; or  (b) cause or procure damage, loss or disadvantage to another person; because that other person:  (c) proposes to produce, or has produced, documents to the Commission; or  (d) proposes to appear or has appeared as a witness before the Commission. Penalty: Imprisonment for 12 months." ;
