    values:originalText "(3) A review by the Tribunal is a re-arbitration of the access dispute based on the information, reports and things referred to in section 44ZZOAA. Note: There are time limits that apply to the Tribunal’s decision on the review: see section 44ZZOA." ;
    cof:pageNumber "232"^^xsd:integer .

