concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zp-ss-5b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "44ZP(5B) Review by Tribunal"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-44zp-ss-5b ;
    values:originalText "(5B) The Tribunal must:  (a) give a copy of the notice to:  (i) the person who applied for review; and  (ii) the other party or parties to the final determination; and  (iii) any other person who has been made a party to the proceedings for review by the Tribunal; and  Access to services  Chapter 2 Access to services  Part IIIA Access to declared services  Division 3  Section 44ZQ  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (b) publish, by electronic or other means, the notice." ;
    skos:definition "(5B) The Tribunal must:  (a) give a copy of the notice to:  (i) the person who applied for review; and  (ii) the other party or parties to the final determination; and  (iii) any other person who has been made a party to the proceedings for review by the Tribunal; and  Access to services  Chapter 2 Access to services  Part IIIA Access to declared services  Division 3  Section 44ZQ  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (b) publish, by electronic or other means, the notice."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3128a542b2cb9a3c6f1e6de834e96a9f0a92ab585830959175ccc24f43ad7bfd" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zp ;
    cof:pageNumber "232"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The Tribunal must give a copy of the notice to certain parties and publish it." ;
