concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zq a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "44ZQ Provisions that do not apply in relation to a Tribunal review"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-44zq ;
    values:originalText "Sections 37, 39 to 43 (inclusive) and 103 to 110 (inclusive) do not apply in relation to a review by the Tribunal of a final determination made by the Commission." ;
    skos:definition "Sections 37, 39 to 43 (inclusive) and 103 to 110 (inclusive) do not apply in relation to a review by the Tribunal of a final determination made by the Commission."@en ;
