doc:sec-44zs-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "44ZS(3) Operation and implementation of a determination that is" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) If an order is in force under subsection (2) (including an order previously varied under this subsection), the Federal Court or a judge of the Federal Court may make an order varying or revoking the first-mentioned order." ;
