concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zs-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "44ZS(4) Operation and implementation of a determination that is"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-44zs-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) An order in force under subsection (2) (including an order previously varied under subsection (3)):  (a) is subject to any conditions that are specified in the order; and  (b) has effect until:  (i) the end of any period for the operation of the order that is specified in the order; or  (ii) the giving of a decision on the appeal;  whichever is earlier." ;
    skos:definition "(4) An order in force under subsection (2) (including an order previously varied under subsection (3)):  (a) is subject to any conditions that are specified in the order; and  (b) has effect until:  (i) the end of any period for the operation of the order that is specified in the order; or  (ii) the giving of a decision on the appeal;  whichever is earlier."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6a6fd686f0cca50a0a3c4317e6a9700b61cb217d491ab67ca22111692bd58710" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zs ;
    cof:pageNumber "234"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Order subject to conditions and has effect until appeal decision or specified period end." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
