    skos:prefLabel "45AE Meaning of expressions in other provisions of this Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-45ae ;
    values:originalText "In determining the meaning of an expression used in a provision of this Act (other than this Division, subsection 6(2C), paragraph 76(1B)(b) or subsection 93AB(1A)), this Division is to be disregarded. Subdivision B—Offences etc." ;
