concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45af a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "45AF Making a contract etc. containing a cartel provision"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-45af ;
    values:originalText "Offence  (1) A corporation commits an offence if:  (a) the corporation makes a contract or arrangement, or arrives at an understanding; and  (b) the contract, arrangement or understanding contains a cartel provision. Note: Chapter 2 of the Criminal Code sets out the general principles of criminal responsibility.  (2) The fault element for paragraph (1)(b) is knowledge or belief. Penalty  (3) An offence against subsection (1) is punishable on conviction by a fine not exceeding the greater of the following:  (a) $100,000,000;  (b) if the court can determine the total value of the benefits that:  (i) have been obtained by one or more persons; and  (ii) are reasonably attributable to the commission of the offence;  3 times that total value;  Chapter 3  Restrictive trade practices" ;
    skos:definition "Offence  (1) A corporation commits an offence if:  (a) the corporation makes a contract or arrangement, or arrives at an understanding; and  (b) the contract, arrangement or understanding contains a cartel provision. Note: Chapter 2 of the Criminal Code sets out the general principles of criminal responsibility.  (2) The fault element for paragraph (1)(b) is knowledge or belief. Penalty  (3) An offence against subsection (1) is punishable on conviction by a fine not exceeding the greater of the following:  (a) $100,000,000;  (b) if the court can determine the total value of the benefits that:  (i) have been obtained by one or more persons; and  (ii) are reasonably attributable to the commission of the offence;  3 times that total value;  Chapter 3  Restrictive trade practices"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "cd25b8565d4b57e8f856cf50c696d80d49eb0c79087d2888c0de2bddefadce7e" ;
    cof:pageNumber "291"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45af-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45af-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45af-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
