concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45ag-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "45AG(3) Giving effect to a cartel provision"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-45ag-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) An offence against subsection (1) is punishable on conviction by a fine not exceeding the greater of the following:  (a) $100,000,000;  (b) if the court can determine the total value of the benefits that:  (i) have been obtained by one or more persons; and  (ii) are reasonably attributable to the commission of the offence;  3 times that total value;  (c) if the court cannot determine the total value of those benefits—30% of the corporation’s adjusted turnover during the breach turnover period for the offence.  Restrictive trade practices  Chapter 3 Restrictive trade practices  Part IV Cartel conduct  Division 1  Section 45AH  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  Pre-commencement contracts etc." ;
    skos:definition "(3) An offence against subsection (1) is punishable on conviction by a fine not exceeding the greater of the following:  (a) $100,000,000;  (b) if the court can determine the total value of the benefits that:  (i) have been obtained by one or more persons; and  (ii) are reasonably attributable to the commission of the offence;  3 times that total value;  (c) if the court cannot determine the total value of those benefits—30% of the corporation’s adjusted turnover during the breach turnover period for the offence.  Restrictive trade practices  Chapter 3 Restrictive trade practices  Part IV Cartel conduct  Division 1  Section 45AH  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  Pre-commencement contracts etc."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bbe0bf5b51f94f6b1a3ec344062a57de12b567f1166435771273678f0b4dbb40" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45ag ;
    cof:pageNumber "292"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Offence against subsection (1) is punishable by a fine not exceeding the greater of the following." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.292" ;
