    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) A corporation may be found guilty of an offence against section 45AF or 45AG even if:  (a) each other party to the contract, arrangement or understanding is a person who is not criminally responsible; or  (b) subject to subsection (2), all other parties to the contract, arrangement or understanding have been acquitted of the offence. Note: Party has an extended meaning—see section 45AC." ;
