    values:originalText "If a prosecution against a person for an offence against section 45AF or 45AG is being, or has been, heard by a court, the court may:  (a) grant an injunction under section 80 against the person in relation to:  (i) the conduct that constitutes, or is alleged to constitute, the offence; or  (ii) other conduct of that kind; or  Chapter 3  Restrictive trade practices" ;
    skos:definition "If a prosecution against a person for an offence against section 45AF or 45AG is being, or has been, heard by a court, the court may:  (a) grant an injunction under section 80 against the person in relation to:  (i) the conduct that constitutes, or is alleged to constitute, the offence; or  (ii) other conduct of that kind; or  Chapter 3  Restrictive trade practices"@en ;
