concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45aj a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "45AJ Making a contract etc. containing a cartel provision"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-45aj ;
    values:originalText "A corporation contravenes this section if:  (a) the corporation makes a contract or arrangement, or arrives at an understanding; and  (b) the contract, arrangement or understanding contains a cartel provision. Note: For enforcement, see Part VI." ;
    skos:definition "A corporation contravenes this section if:  (a) the corporation makes a contract or arrangement, or arrives at an understanding; and  (b) the contract, arrangement or understanding contains a cartel provision. Note: For enforcement, see Part VI."@en ;
