    skos:definition "(1) Sections 45AJ and 45AK do not apply in relation to a contract, arrangement or understanding containing a cartel provision if the defendant proves that:  (a) the cartel provision is:  (i) for the purposes of a joint venture; and  Chapter 3  Restrictive trade practices"@en ;
