concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45as-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "45AS(2) Dual listed company arrangement"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-45as-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Sections 45AG and 45AK do not apply in relation to the giving effect to a cartel provision, in so far as:  (a) the cartel provision is a provision of a dual listed company arrangement; and  (b) the giving effect to the cartel provision would, or would apart from section 88, contravene section 49. Note: A defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in subsection (2) (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code and subsection (3) of this section).  Restrictive trade practices  Chapter 3 Restrictive trade practices  Part IV Cartel conduct  Division 1  Section 45AT  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(2) Sections 45AG and 45AK do not apply in relation to the giving effect to a cartel provision, in so far as:  (a) the cartel provision is a provision of a dual listed company arrangement; and  (b) the giving effect to the cartel provision would, or would apart from section 88, contravene section 49. Note: A defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in subsection (2) (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code and subsection (3) of this section).  Restrictive trade practices  Chapter 3 Restrictive trade practices  Part IV Cartel conduct  Division 1  Section 45AT  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026"@en ;
