    values:originalText "(5) The person contravenes this subsection if the Commission is not notified of the change of fact, as soon as practicable after the person becomes aware of the change, by:  (a) if the person is the only notifying party of the notification of the acquisition—the person; or  (b) otherwise—all of the notifying parties jointly. Note: For enforcement, see Part VI." ;
    skos:definition "(5) The person contravenes this subsection if the Commission is not notified of the change of fact, as soon as practicable after the person becomes aware of the change, by:  (a) if the person is the only notifying party of the notification of the acquisition—the person; or  (b) otherwise—all of the notifying parties jointly. Note: For enforcement, see Part VI."@en ;
