concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-48 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "48 Resale price maintenance"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-48 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A corporation or other person shall not engage in the practice of resale price maintenance.  (2) Subsection (1) does not apply to a corporation or other person engaging in conduct that constitutes the practice of resale price maintenance if:  Restrictive trade practices  Chapter 3 Restrictive trade practices  Part IV Other provisions  Division 2  Section 49  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (a) the corporation or other person has given the Commission a notice under subsection 93(1) describing the conduct; and  (b) the notice is in force under section 93." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A corporation or other person shall not engage in the practice of resale price maintenance.  (2) Subsection (1) does not apply to a corporation or other person engaging in conduct that constitutes the practice of resale price maintenance if:  Restrictive trade practices  Chapter 3 Restrictive trade practices  Part IV Other provisions  Division 2  Section 49  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (a) the corporation or other person has given the Commission a notice under subsection 93(1) describing the conduct; and  (b) the notice is in force under section 93."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d762eceed760020f17fe014aa49a18374bdf94328af1d3f62bdde303356ce78b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "334"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-48-ss-1 ;
