    skos:definition "(2) A person must not directly or indirectly:  (a) acquire shares in the capital of a corporation; or  Restrictive trade practices  Chapter 3 Restrictive trade practices  Part IV Other provisions  Division 2  Section 50  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (b) acquire any assets of a corporation; if the acquisition would have the effect, or be likely to have the effect, of substantially lessening competition in any market. Note: The person will not be prevented from making the acquisition if the person is granted an authorisation for the acquisition under section 88."@en ;
