concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-50-ss-3a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "50(3A) Prohibition of acquisitions that would result in a substantial"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-50-ss-3a ;
    values:originalText "(3A) Subsections 46(3) to (8) have effect for the purposes of this section as if:  (a) a reference in those subsections (other than in paragraph 46(8)(b)) to section 46 included a reference to this section; and  (b) a reference in those subsections to a market were a reference to a market (within the meaning of this section). Note: Subsections 46(3) to (8) contain matters relevant to working out whether a corporation has a substantial degree of power in a market." ;
    skos:definition "(3A) Subsections 46(3) to (8) have effect for the purposes of this section as if:  (a) a reference in those subsections (other than in paragraph 46(8)(b)) to section 46 included a reference to this section; and  (b) a reference in those subsections to a market were a reference to a market (within the meaning of this section). Note: Subsections 46(3) to (8) contain matters relevant to working out whether a corporation has a substantial degree of power in a market."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d9c7f60d67052f2c1b0f17b8728f79c0669ce5264dfec535a7d88112be5245e3" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-50 ;
    cof:pageNumber "336"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Prohibition of acquisitions that would result in a substantial degree of power in a market." ;
