icant substitution of domestic products for imported goods; and  (b) without limiting the matters that may be taken into account, the Tribunal must take into account all other relevant matters that relate to the international competitiveness of any Australian industry.  (2) Where an application under subsection (1) is made:  (a) the Tribunal shall give to:  (i) each corporation in relation to which the application relates; and  Chapter 3  Restrictive trade practices" ;
