doc:sec-51ae-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "51AE(1) Regulations relating to industry codes" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The regulations may:  (a) prescribe an industry code, or specified provisions of an industry code, for the purposes of this Part; and  (b) declare the industry code to be a mandatory industry code or a voluntary industry code; and  (c) for a voluntary industry code, specify the method by which a corporation agrees to be bound by the code and the method by which it ceases to be so bound (by reference to provisions of the code or otherwise). Conferral of functions and powers" ;
    cof:pageNumber "440"^^xsd:integer .

