doc:sec-51ae-ss-1c a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "51AE(1C) Regulations relating to industry codes" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1C) If an industry code prescribed by the regulations confers on a person or body a function or power in relation to the code, the code may provide that the function or power is to be exercised by legislative instrument or other kind of written instrument." ;
