concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "52C Interacting with content"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-52c ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this Part, a user of a service interacts with content made available by the service if:  (a) the content is reproduced on the service, or is otherwise placed on the service, and the user interacts with the content; or  (b) a link to the content is provided on the service and the user interacts with the link; or  (c) an extract of the content is provided on the service and the user interacts with the extract.  (2) Subsection (1) does not limit, for the purposes of this Part, the ways in which a user of a service interacts with content made available by a service.  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4 News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code  Part IVBA Basic concepts  Division 1  Section 52D  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(1) For the purposes of this Part, a user of a service interacts with content made available by the service if:  (a) the content is reproduced on the service, or is otherwise placed on the service, and the user interacts with the content; or  (b) a link to the content is provided on the service and the user interacts with the link; or  (c) an extract of the content is provided on the service and the user interacts with the extract.  (2) Subsection (1) does not limit, for the purposes of this Part, the ways in which a user of a service interacts with content made available by a service.  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4 News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code  Part IVBA Basic concepts  Division 1  Section 52D  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026"@en ;
