    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Subsection (1) does not limit, for the purposes of this Part, the ways in which a user of a service interacts with content made available by a service.  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4 News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code  Part IVBA Basic concepts  Division 1  Section 52D  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026" ;
