doc:sec-52g a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "52G Registration of news business and news business corporation" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) If the ACMA considers that the requirement in subsection (2) is met, the ACMA must:  (a) if the news business is not already a registered news business—register the news business; and  Chapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc. Part IVBA  News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code" ;
