concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52h-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "52H(5) Revocation of registration or endorsement—general"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-52h-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) The ACMA may revoke the registration of a registered news business corporation if the corporation is not endorsed as the registered news business corporation for at least one registered news business. Revocation of registration of endorsement of corporation for news business" ;
    skos:definition "(5) The ACMA may revoke the registration of a registered news business corporation if the corporation is not endorsed as the registered news business corporation for at least one registered news business. Revocation of registration of endorsement of corporation for news business"@en ;
