doc:sec-52k-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "52K(2) Adding or removing news source from registered news business" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The application must:  (a) be in writing; and  (b) set out every news source that comprises the news business; and  (c) specify the news source to be added or removed; and  (d) if regulations made for the purposes of this paragraph specify requirements—meet those requirements." ;
    cof:pageNumber "457"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52k-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "52K(3) Adding or removing news source from registered news business"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-52k-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The ACMA may add the news source to the news business if the ACMA considers that:  (a) the application is in accordance with subsection (2); and  (b) the news source does not form part of another news business that is a registered news business; and  (c) the corporation would continue to meet the requirement in 52L (connection between applicant corporation and news  Chapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc. Part IVBA  News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code" ;
    skos:definition "(3) The ACMA may add the news source to the news business if the ACMA considers that:  (a) the application is in accordance with subsection (2); and  (b) the news source does not form part of another news business that is a registered news business; and  (c) the corporation would continue to meet the requirement in 52L (connection between applicant corporation and news  Chapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc. Part IVBA  News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5c5985b12b6fd0fc67cd3f20522f2da21314c795e8f6c1c04061fffe629b25a4" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52k ;
    cof:pageNumber "457"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The ACMA may add a news source to the registered news business if certain conditions are met." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
