    skos:prefLabel "52ZB Personal information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-52zb ;
    values:originalText "Nothing in this Division requires or authorises the giving of information that is personal information (within the meaning of the Privacy Act 1988).  Chapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc. Part IVBA  News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code" ;
    skos:definition "Nothing in this Division requires or authorises the giving of information that is personal information (within the meaning of the Privacy Act 1988).  Chapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc. Part IVBA  News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code"@en ;
