    cof:title "52ZD(2) Bargaining news business representative for a registered news" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Subsection (3) applies if:  (a) a registered news business corporation for a registered news business makes an agreement in writing with a person; and  (b) the agreement provides that the person should be the bargaining news business representative for the registered news business." ;
    cof:pageNumber "472"^^xsd:integer .

