    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "This Subdivision applies if a notification is made for the purposes of subsection 52ZE(1).  Chapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc. Part IVBA  News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code" ;
