doc:sec-52zl-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "52ZL(2) Notification of arbitration" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The bargaining party that is the bargaining news business representative may give a notice to the Commission that arbitration about the remuneration issue should start, if:  (a) both of the following conditions are satisfied:  Chapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc. Part IVBA  News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code" ;
