    skos:definition "(6) For the purposes of this section, a person has a conflict of interest in relation to the arbitration if the person has any interest, pecuniary or otherwise, that could conflict with the proper performance of the person’s functions in relation to the arbitration.  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4 News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code  Part IVBA Arbitration about remuneration issue  Division 7  Section 52ZO  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026"@en ;
