concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zo a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "52ZO Costs of arbitral panel"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-52zo ;
    values:originalText "(1) The bargaining parties must each pay half of the costs of each member of the panel.  (2) Each member of the panel is to determine that member’s costs, worked out as daily costs.  (3) If regulations made for the purposes of this subsection specify rules relating to those costs (including the amount of those costs), the bargaining parties must comply with those rules." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The bargaining parties must each pay half of the costs of each member of the panel.  (2) Each member of the panel is to determine that member’s costs, worked out as daily costs.  (3) If regulations made for the purposes of this subsection specify rules relating to those costs (including the amount of those costs), the bargaining parties must comply with those rules."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7874ba581d27eafc09faaa093814d0c697a7ac968ec50bb0d672d16e72c3b19a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "481"^^xsd:integer ;
