concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zq a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "52ZQ Bargaining parties’ agreement about dealing with extra"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-52zq ;
    values:originalText "services in arbitration  (1) The bargaining parties may agree, in writing, that specified services other than the designated digital platform service should be dealt with in the arbitration.  (2) If the bargaining parties notify the Chair of the agreement before the start of the arbitration, Subdivision C applies as if:  (a) the remuneration issue related to the designated digital platform service and the specified services mentioned in subsection (1); and  Chapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc. Part IVBA  News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code" ;
    skos:definition "services in arbitration  (1) The bargaining parties may agree, in writing, that specified services other than the designated digital platform service should be dealt with in the arbitration.  (2) If the bargaining parties notify the Chair of the agreement before the start of the arbitration, Subdivision C applies as if:  (a) the remuneration issue related to the designated digital platform service and the specified services mentioned in subsection (1); and  Chapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc. Part IVBA  News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "47168b3696399d8c5c92828da5133718af4a12f0cf87b299a8db177161241d82" ;
    cof:pageNumber "481"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zq-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zq-ss-2 ;
