doc:sec-52zy-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "52ZY(2) Final offer arbitration—termination of arbitration if no final" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) In considering the matters set out in subsection (1), the panel must consider the bargaining power imbalance between Australian news businesses and the designated digital platform corporation. 52ZZA  Other requirements for arbitration determination" ;
    cof:pageNumber "488"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zy-ss-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "52ZY(1) Final offer arbitration—termination of arbitration if no final"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-52zy-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The panel must make the determination no later than 35 business days (or, if the regulations specify a different period, the end of that period) after the latest of the following days:  (a) the last day on which a final offer may be submitted in accordance with subsection 52ZX(4);  (b) the last day on which a submission may be given by a bargaining party in accordance with subsection 52ZZB(1);  (c) the last day on which a submission may be given by the Commission in accordance with subsection 52ZZC(1);  (d) the last day on which a submission may be given by a bargaining party in accordance with subsection 52ZZC(3).  Chapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc. Part IVBA  News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The panel must make the determination no later than 35 business days (or, if the regulations specify a different period, the end of that period) after the latest of the following days:  (a) the last day on which a final offer may be submitted in accordance with subsection 52ZX(4);  (b) the last day on which a submission may be given by a bargaining party in accordance with subsection 52ZZB(1);  (c) the last day on which a submission may be given by the Commission in accordance with subsection 52ZZC(1);  (d) the last day on which a submission may be given by a bargaining party in accordance with subsection 52ZZC(3).  Chapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc. Part IVBA  News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "184825c169e2556a04073e76825a93e5492ef23e20cf56bc6a93478910710db1" ;
