concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53l a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "53L Regulations may prescribe gas market codes"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-53l ;
    values:originalText "(1) The regulations may prescribe matters required or permitted by this Act to be prescribed by a gas market code. Note: For the matters that may be included in a gas market code, see Subdivisions B and D and subsection 53ZJ(1).  (2) To avoid doubt, subsection (1) does not limit section 172 (power to make regulations)." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The regulations may prescribe matters required or permitted by this Act to be prescribed by a gas market code. Note: For the matters that may be included in a gas market code, see Subdivisions B and D and subsection 53ZJ(1).  (2) To avoid doubt, subsection (1) does not limit section 172 (power to make regulations)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "115089a6cd361c23a590911b3c8fecd461d60f3eb5447b5b2240feed56056201" ;
    cof:pageNumber "514"^^xsd:integer ;
