doc:sec-53m-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "53M(2) Minister may make gas market emergency price orders" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) To avoid doubt, a gas market emergency price order may not do the following:  (a) create an offence;  (b) provide powers of:  (i) arrest or detention; or  (ii) entry, search or seizure;  (c) impose a tax;  (d) set an amount to be appropriated from the Consolidated Revenue Fund under an appropriation in this Act;  (e) directly amend the text of this Act." ;
    cof:pageNumber "514"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53m-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "53M(3) Minister may make gas market emergency price orders"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-53m-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A gas market emergency price order that is inconsistent with the regulations has no effect to the extent of the inconsistency, but a gas market emergency price order is taken to be consistent with the  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4 Gas market  Part IVBB Gas market instruments  Division 2  Section 53N  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  regulations to the extent that the gas market emergency price order is capable of operating concurrently with the regulations. Consultation before making gas market emergency price orders" ;
    skos:definition "(3) A gas market emergency price order that is inconsistent with the regulations has no effect to the extent of the inconsistency, but a gas market emergency price order is taken to be consistent with the  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4 Gas market  Part IVBB Gas market instruments  Division 2  Section 53N  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  regulations to the extent that the gas market emergency price order is capable of operating concurrently with the regulations. Consultation before making gas market emergency price orders"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8bc5aa9ff4e9985213beec1893b9776d0593d906e1a829e2565484b0ff8fe639" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53m ;
