doc:sec-53m-ss-7 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "53M(7) Minister may make gas market emergency price orders" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(7) A gas market emergency price order is repealed by force of this subsection at the time specified by subsection (8), unless the gas market emergency price order is repealed earlier." ;
    cof:pageNumber "514"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53m-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "53M(8) Minister may make gas market emergency price orders"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-53m-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) For the purposes of subsections (6) and (7), the time is the time occurring:  (a) if any provision of any gas market emergency price order commences during the 12 months starting on the commencement of this section—12 months after the earliest time any provision of any gas market emergency price order commences; or  (b) otherwise—12 months after the commencement of this section." ;
    skos:definition "(8) For the purposes of subsections (6) and (7), the time is the time occurring:  (a) if any provision of any gas market emergency price order commences during the 12 months starting on the commencement of this section—12 months after the earliest time any provision of any gas market emergency price order commences; or  (b) otherwise—12 months after the commencement of this section."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "06cf2af922311a0027bb84c1aad826be1c6527b42ecac4d0822a07b3679e6793" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53m ;
    cof:pageNumber "514"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Defines time for gas market emergency price orders" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
