concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53s a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "53S Agreements"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-53s ;
    values:originalText "(1) A gas market code may include rules about agreements relating to supplying or acquiring a gas commodity, including:  (a) rules requiring a gas market participant to enter, or not to enter, into an agreement in specified circumstances; or  (b) rules about any of the following matters:  (i) the manner in which an agreement is made (for example, in writing);  (ii) matters dealt with in an agreement, including, in the case of an agreement to supply or acquire a gas commodity, the matters mentioned in subsection (2);  (iii) withdrawing from or ending an agreement. Example: Rules requiring specified matters to be dealt with, or not dealt with, in an agreement.  Chapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc. Part IVBB  Gas market" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A gas market code may include rules about agreements relating to supplying or acquiring a gas commodity, including:  (a) rules requiring a gas market participant to enter, or not to enter, into an agreement in specified circumstances; or  (b) rules about any of the following matters:  (i) the manner in which an agreement is made (for example, in writing);  (ii) matters dealt with in an agreement, including, in the case of an agreement to supply or acquire a gas commodity, the matters mentioned in subsection (2);  (iii) withdrawing from or ending an agreement. Example: Rules requiring specified matters to be dealt with, or not dealt with, in an agreement.  Chapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc. Part IVBB  Gas market"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "977ce377a7ea8fef76e126c11e1ef460d70a2e53207cc2e3ee864913430c9776" ;
    cof:pageNumber "519"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Rules about agreements relating to supplying or acquiring a gas commodity" ;
