concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53ze-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "53ZE(3) What gas market instruments may refer to"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-53ze-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A gas market instrument may make provision in relation to a matter (including setting a price):  (a) by reference to:  (i) the price of any gas commodity or other goods or services anywhere inside or outside Australia; or  (ii) any published information about any market (whether inside or outside Australia); or  (b) by reference to, or by providing for, a formula or method.  Chapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc. Part IVBB  Gas market" ;
    skos:definition "(3) A gas market instrument may make provision in relation to a matter (including setting a price):  (a) by reference to:  (i) the price of any gas commodity or other goods or services anywhere inside or outside Australia; or  (ii) any published information about any market (whether inside or outside Australia); or  (b) by reference to, or by providing for, a formula or method.  Chapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc. Part IVBB  Gas market"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "68f6e839f791e791e7287cbc8a2fd4e5701b56f298e7571396d0b218d61e3483" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53ze ;
    cof:pageNumber "531"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Defines what a gas market instrument may refer to in relation to setting a price." ;
