concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zk a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "53ZK Infringement notices"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-53zk ;
    values:originalText "Object  (1) The object of this section is for Division 5 of Part XI to apply to a provision to which this section applies in a corresponding way to the way that Division applies to a provision of Part 2-2 of the Australian Consumer Law. Note: That Division is about infringement notices issued for alleged contraventions of provisions of the Australian Consumer Law.  (2) This section applies to the following provisions:  (a) subsection 53ZQ(1);  (b) subsection 53ZQ(2);  (c) subsection 53ZQ(3);  (d) section 53ZV;  (e) subsection 53ZW(1);  (f) a civil penalty provision of a gas market instrument, other than a provision that is a requirement for a gas market participant to deal with another gas market participant in good faith as mentioned in paragraph 53Q(b). Extended application of Division 5 of Part XI etc.  (3) Division 5 of Part XI, and any other provision of this Act that relates to that Division, also apply in relation to a provision to which this section applies as if:  (a) the substitutions in the following table were made; and  (b) the following substitutions were made:  (i) for a reference in item 1 of the table in section 134C to 60 penalty units, substitute a reference to 600 penalty units;  (ii) for a reference in that item to 12 penalty units, substitute a reference to 60 penalty units.   Chapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc. Part IVBB  Gas market" ;
    skos:definition "Object  (1) The object of this section is for Division 5 of Part XI to apply to a provision to which this section applies in a corresponding way to the way that Division applies to a provision of Part 2-2 of the Australian Consumer Law. Note: That Division is about infringement notices issued for alleged contraventions of provisions of the Australian Consumer Law.  (2) This section applies to the following provisions:  (a) subsection 53ZQ(1);  (b) subsection 53ZQ(2);  (c) subsection 53ZQ(3);  (d) section 53ZV;  (e) subsection 53ZW(1);  (f) a civil penalty provision of a gas market instrument, other than a provision that is a requirement for a gas market participant to deal with another gas market participant in good faith as mentioned in paragraph 53Q(b). Extended application of Division 5 of Part XI etc.  (3) Division 5 of Part XI, and any other provision of this Act that relates to that Division, also apply in relation to a provision to which this section applies as if:  (a) the substitutions in the following table were made; and  (b) the following substitutions were made:  (i) for a reference in item 1 of the table in section 134C to 60 penalty units, substitute a reference to 600 penalty units;  (ii) for a reference in that item to 12 penalty units, substitute a reference to 60 penalty units.   Chapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc. Part IVBB  Gas market"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "62a6da8735c18e2d66fe5de3dc5440252a1da49e3cbaa7c1d2d5068ad73ffba0" ;
    cof:pageNumber "535"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zk-ss-1 ;
