doc:sec-53zn-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "53ZN(3) Proceedings for defamation not to lie" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) A court must not make an order under subsection (1) unless the court considers that the order will:  (a) redress, in whole or in part, the loss or damage suffered by the non-parties in relation to the contravening conduct; or  (b) prevent or reduce the loss or damage suffered, or likely to be suffered, by the non-parties in relation to the contravening conduct.  Chapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc. Part IVBB  Gas market" ;
    cof:pageNumber "538"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zp a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "53ZP Kinds of orders that may be made to redress loss or damage"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-53zp ;
    values:originalText "suffered by non-parties etc.  Without limiting subsection 53ZO(1), the orders that a court may make under that subsection against a person (the respondent) include all or any of the following:  (a) an order declaring the whole or any part of a contract made between the respondent and a non-party referred to in that subsection, or a collateral arrangement relating to such a contract:  (i) to be void; and  (ii) if the court thinks fit—to have been void ab initio or void at all times on and after such date as is specified in  Chapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc. Part IVBB  Gas market" ;
    skos:definition "suffered by non-parties etc.  Without limiting subsection 53ZO(1), the orders that a court may make under that subsection against a person (the respondent) include all or any of the following:  (a) an order declaring the whole or any part of a contract made between the respondent and a non-party referred to in that subsection, or a collateral arrangement relating to such a contract:  (i) to be void; and  (ii) if the court thinks fit—to have been void ab initio or void at all times on and after such date as is specified in  Chapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc. Part IVBB  Gas market"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "eca3e84685fd1891d174531a1ec065736c38c11e3173763650299ba82b67339d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "541"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Orders that may be made to redress loss or damage suffered by non-parties." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.541" ;
    cml:asserts concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zp-norm .
