concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zt a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "53ZT Commission may require person to provide information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-53zt ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies if a person is required to keep, to generate or to publish information or a document under a gas market instrument.  (2) The Commission may give the person a written notice that requires the person to give the information, or to produce the document, to the Commission within a specified period and in a specified manner.  (3) The notice must:  (a) name the person to which it is given; and  (b) specify:  (i) the information or document to which it relates; and  (ii) the provisions of the gas market instrument which require the person to keep, to generate or to publish the information or document; and  (c) explain the effect of sections 53ZU, 53ZV and 53ZW.  (4) The notice may relate to more than one piece of information or more than one document." ;
    skos:definition "(1) This section applies if a person is required to keep, to generate or to publish information or a document under a gas market instrument.  (2) The Commission may give the person a written notice that requires the person to give the information, or to produce the document, to the Commission within a specified period and in a specified manner.  (3) The notice must:  (a) name the person to which it is given; and  (b) specify:  (i) the information or document to which it relates; and  (ii) the provisions of the gas market instrument which require the person to keep, to generate or to publish the information or document; and  (c) explain the effect of sections 53ZU, 53ZV and 53ZW.  (4) The notice may relate to more than one piece of information or more than one document."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8b7ebed3f9e9313c7d6bc81eee1da7cc223036539bdf98b4858dc2f6799c955a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "545"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zt-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zt-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zt-ss-3 ;
