concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zu a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "53ZU Extending periods for complying with notices"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-53zu ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person who has been given a notice under section 53ZT may, at any time within the period within which the person must comply with the notice (as extended under any previous application of subsection (2) of this section), apply in writing to the Commission for an extension of the period for complying with the notice.  (2) A member of the Commission may, by written notice given to the person, extend the period within which the person must comply with the notice.  Chapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc. Part IVBB  Gas market" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person who has been given a notice under section 53ZT may, at any time within the period within which the person must comply with the notice (as extended under any previous application of subsection (2) of this section), apply in writing to the Commission for an extension of the period for complying with the notice.  (2) A member of the Commission may, by written notice given to the person, extend the period within which the person must comply with the notice.  Chapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc. Part IVBB  Gas market"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bf4c3e8d1f26ad9f097f48bcca38049a6a57e23f0e7892645a4aa5dfbefd0607" ;
    cof:pageNumber "545"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zu-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zu-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.545" .
