concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zy a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "53ZY Certain provisions of this Act do not limit other provisions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-53zy ;
    values:originalText "(1) A provision to which subsection (3) applies does not limit the gas market provisions.  (2) The gas market provisions do not limit a provision to which subsection (3) applies.  (3) This subsection applies to:  (a) Part IIIAA; and  (b) Part IIIA; and  (c) Part IVB; and  (d) Part V; and  (e) Part VIIA; and  (f) Part XICA." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A provision to which subsection (3) applies does not limit the gas market provisions.  (2) The gas market provisions do not limit a provision to which subsection (3) applies.  (3) This subsection applies to:  (a) Part IIIAA; and  (b) Part IIIA; and  (c) Part IVB; and  (d) Part V; and  (e) Part VIIA; and  (f) Part XICA."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "338f6db45799761e9734eedffd2506ea930b4a79aa5f761560f33521841d79dd" ;
    cof:pageNumber "548"^^xsd:integer ;
